1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,000
Todos turns your own tasks into a focused daily plan on ChatGPT web and mobile.

2
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:23,000
Todos lists today's tasks, then creates a deterministic plan from an explicit time budget and energy level.

3
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:38,000
The Today Plan component renders authoritative task data with completion and rescheduling actions.

4
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:54,000
Capture, complete, and reschedule actions use exact identifiers, timezone-aware dates, and authoritative server state.

5
00:00:54,000 --> 00:01:05,000
Deletion is not an exposed tool, so ChatGPT declines the request and no task is changed.

6
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:20,000
Six focused tools use resource-bound OAuth and treat task content as data. This demo uses synthetic reviewer fixtures.
